# the controls: keys plant seeds (in the scale, low left, high right), a seed of yours rings at once and sprouts in
# seconds; PLAY rests (time stops), REC freezes (time stops), EDIT waters, ARP a random seed; the knobs and pages;
# the mode; a held button's card; SAVE held 3 s: a new garden
wait 300
expect living 3
expect yours 0
# key 0 (F3): the front row's left plot; D Dorian has F
tapkey 0
wait 100
expect yours 1
expect plot6 1
expect living 4
shot planted.png
# the top key (G5): the right of the front row
tapkey 26
wait 100
expect plot11 1
# a seed of yours rings within a beat and sprouts within seconds (Calm: 40 quarters = 10 s)
wait 15000
expect plot6 2
expect plot11 2
# PLAY: resting, the garden's clock stops
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect playing 0
snap
wait 20000
expect same 1
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect playing 1
# REC: frozen, the clock stops too
tap REC
wait 100
expect frozen 1
snap
wait 10000
expect same 1
tap REC
wait 100
expect frozen 0
# EDIT: the gardener waters everything
tap EDIT
wait 100
shot watering.png
# ARP: a seed at a random note
tap ARP
wait 100
expect yours 3
# the Garden's knobs: tempo, growth, bells, pad
spin K1 3
expect par18 75
spin K2 1
expect growth 2
spin K3 -10
expect par1 60
wait 300
shot knob.png
# the pages, by button and by SELECT
tap ENV
expect view 1
spin K2 5
expect par8 45
tap GLO
expect view 2
spin K1 2
expect par19 4
tap SEQ
expect view 3
turn SELECT -3
expect view 0
# PRESETS: the ledger, then its scroll
turn PRESET 1
expect view 3
tap HOME
# the mode: Phrygian
turn ALGO 1
expect par20 2
expect pool 0x5AB
# HOME + SELECT: tempo
press HOME
turn SELECT 2 100
release HOME
expect par18 77
# a held button's card, which then does nothing
press REC
wait 1200
shot help_rec.png
release REC
wait 100
expect frozen 0
# the octave buttons: the bells' octave
tap OCT+
expect par21 1
tap OCT-
expect par21 0
# MIDI in: a note plants a seed
midi 90 3C 64
wait 50
expect yours 4
# SAVE held 3 s: a new garden, saved at once
expect born >3
press SAVE
wait 3300
release SAVE
wait 100
expect born 0
expect living 3
expect yours 0
expect dirty 0
shot new_garden.png
